  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/kgPmdbHD/lios-seafaring-dungeons.png\" alt=\"lios-seafaring-dungeons\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">欢迎来到<strong>Lio's Seafaring Dungeons</strong>！本模组为您的 Minecraft 世界增添了多种全新的地牢，既有水下也有地下。您将发现独特的结构，其中充满了自定义战利品、具有挑战性的敌人和等待征服的Boss房间。</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/pBZGPGy1/dungeon-types.png\" alt=\"地牢类型\" width=\"464\" height=\"38\"></p><ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>苔石海洋地牢</strong> – 这些地牢生成在较温暖的海洋气候中</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>砂岩海洋地牢</strong> – 可在较冷的海洋气候中找到</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>地下陆地地牢</strong> – 广阔无垠的地下地牢，隐藏在地表之下</li>\n</ul><div style=\"border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.12)\"><a style=\"display:flex;text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lioloader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display:block\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/wrK85wgc/logo.png\" alt=\"LioLoader\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\">\n<div style=\"text-align:left;line-height:1.35\">\n<div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:bold\">需要基于数据包的配置？</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:14px\">查看<strong>LioLoader</strong>，实现全局数据包/资源包加载。适用于 <strong>NeoForge</strong> 和 <strong>Fabric</strong>，支持 <strong>Minecraft 1.21.x</strong>。</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:13px\">在CurseForge上打开LioLoader →</div>\n</div>\n</a></div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://url-shortener.curseforge.com/xiKHo\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/gFGT7zG/bisecthosting.png\" alt=\"bisecthosting\" width=\"803\" height=\"77\"> </a></p><p><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/fV6VtS4Q/youtube-reviews.png\" alt=\"YouTube评测\" width=\"605\" height=\"44\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<div><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Xhst1_TfmcE?start=1117\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></div>\n<div><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/E-ycJzZalDg\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div><h2><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fsPHes7q4Pr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/qDNhg49/636e0a6a49cf127bf92de1e2-icon-clyde-blurple-RGB.png\" width=\"128\" height=\"97\"><br></a></h2><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/hJvQHRN5/usageinmodpacks.png\" alt=\"整合包使用说明\" width=\"602\" height=\"41\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><br></strong>本模组可随意在任何整合包中使用，无需额外许可。尽情将其纳入您的整合包，畅享 Lio's Seafaring Dungeons 带来的全部精彩内容！</p>",
